    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"pain\" though. it's the silence. when i was competing, everything was loud and purposeful. every movement mattered. now i just wake up and there's nothing to do, nothing to strive for. it feels like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. like the real person finished their story a long time ago and i'm just the credits rolling after the movie is already over. does that make sense?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
